{"id":"12e873534fa3ba64","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents.md","title":"AC Equivalents","display":"thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents — AC Equivalents","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents","aliases":["58-thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents"],"display":"thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents — AC Equivalents","depends_on":["[[58-ax-ac]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents — AC Equivalents"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"58-ax-ac\">58-ax-ac</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}_S\\)</span> denotes the axiom sentence in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"58-ax-ac\">58-ax-ac</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,c\\in V\">\\(X,c\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the exact function predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}of\\text{-}choice\\text{-}equivalents}\\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall X\\in V\\;\\exists c\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\},X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\;(c(A)\\in A)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}of\\text{-}choice\\text{-}equivalents}\\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall X\\in V\\;\\exists c\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\},X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\;(c(A)\\in A)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The axiom of choice has many equivalent formulations.</li>\n<li>Zorn's lemma, well-ordering theorem, and Tukey's lemma are all equivalent to AC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-ac","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-ac]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-ac","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}_S$ denotes the axiom sentence in [[58-ax-ac]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}_S","display":false},{"tex":"X,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}of\\text{-}choice\\text{-}equivalents}\\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall X\\in V\\;\\exists c\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\},X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\;(c(A)\\in A)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":927,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4034","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents.md|58-thm-axiom-of-choice-equivalents]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["b3dac4cf78c440c7","36d7463d215be751"]}